{"version":1,"content":"<p>內地汽車媒體日前公布華為新能源車「尊界V800」煞車踏板支架斷裂測試影片，輿論怒批「速成車」。</p><p>尊界今天公布第三方測試，聲稱符合標準且在加嚴檢驗中未出現裂紋和損壞。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-13T06:40:24.285230+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":82,"images":0,"source":"明報 中國","fallback":"rss-blocked"},"published_at":"2026-10-13T06:10:54+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-13T06:37:53.466813+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:37:53.466813+00:00","content_hash":"9eababbfa41acafaf1cfd43ea06b6ed96a1b9fa068c79241e395e34da714ceac","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null}